  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">更多食物模組由<a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/members/volwert123\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Volwert123</a>開發。新增了多種食物，例如：</span></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">烤胡蘿蔔</span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">海帶湯</span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">米飯</span></span></li>\n</ul><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">為製作這些食物，還新增了全新的食材！</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">建議搭配模組<strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jei\" rel=\"nofollow\">Just Enough Items</a></strong>查看所有合成配方。</span></p><hr><p><strong><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">支援語言&nbsp;</span></strong><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">英文、德文、法文、西班牙文、俄文</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">&nbsp;更多語言即將推出。</span></p><hr><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><strong>計畫功能</strong></span></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">更多語言支援</span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">更多食物種類</span></span></li>\n</ul>",
